4
00:00:12.710 --> 00:00:16.269
Today we learn: Good Manners. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:21.170
Please. Say it with me. Please!

6
00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:28.270
Thank you. Say it with me. Thank you!

7
00:00:31.768 --> 00:00:35.635
Sorry. Say it with me. Sorry!

8
00:00:39.135 --> 00:00:42.918
Share. Say it with me. Share!

9
00:00:46.432 --> 00:00:49.949
Help. Say it with me. Help!

10
00:00:53.430 --> 00:00:56.464
Kind. Say it with me. Kind!

11
00:00:59.969 --> 00:01:03.602
Wait. Say it with me. Wait!

12
00:01:07.097 --> 00:01:10.881
Listen. Say it with me. Listen!

13
00:01:14.393 --> 00:01:18.226
Smile. Say it with me. Smile!

14
00:01:21.724 --> 00:01:26.007
Hello again. Say it with me. Hello again!

15
00:01:29.491 --> 00:01:32.974
Welcome. Say it with me. Welcome!

16
00:01:36.499 --> 00:01:40.583
Respect. Say it with me. Respect!

17
00:01:44.051 --> 00:01:53.336
Grammar time! Say please  or  thank you. Listen. Please help me. Thank you for your help.

18
00:01:53.386 --> 00:01:58.923
Your turn. Say it with me. Please help me. Thank you for your help.

19
