I always say please and thank you. I like to share my toys and help my friends.

20
00:02:09.522 --> 00:02:10.876
I like this story!

21
00:02:11.556 --> 00:02:16.898
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:16.948 --> 00:02:18.098
Sorry!

23
00:02:19.254 --> 00:02:24.657
Look! What's the word?

24
00:02:24.707 --> 00:02:25.857
Wait!

25
00:02:26.652 --> 00:02:34.601
Think and answer. What do you say when someone helps you?

26
00:02:34.651 --> 00:02:35.801
Great answer!

27
00:02:36.835 --> 00:02:39.380
This unit's value is Politeness.

28
00:02:39.430 --> 00:02:41.543
I can show politeness every day!

29
00:02:42.236 --> 00:02:47.216
Great work today! See you next time. Bye-bye!

